00:02:16.685 --> 00:02:18.486
I THINK EVEN BY MASSACHUSETTS

00:02:18.487 --> 00:02:20.855
STANDARDS, THIS IS A LITTLE BIT

00:02:20.856 --> 00:02:22.057
