00:02:22.058 --> 00:02:25.260
IT HAS LIED TO, ACCORDING TO

00:02:25.261 --> 00:02:26.261
"THE BOSTON GLOBE," A FEDERAL

00:02:26.262 --> 00:02:26.694
INVESTIGATION.

00:02:26.695 --> 00:02:27.462
A GRAND JURY INVESTIGATION.

00:02:27.463 --> 00:02:30.298
THAT COME IN AND OF ITSELF, IS

00:02:30.299 --> 00:02:30.765
QUITE UNUSUAL.

00:02:30.766 --> 00:02:32.300
&gt;&gt; Laura: HE HAS SINCE BEEN

00:02:32.301 --> 00:02:33.268
CAUGHT, I WANT TO MAKE SURE I

00:02:33.269 --> 00:02:34.035
