00:02:34.036 --> 00:02:36.337
HE HAS SINCE BEEN CAUGHT.

00:02:36.338 --> 00:02:39.340
THE UNDERLYING FACTS OF THIS ARE

00:02:39.341 --> 00:02:40.241
